@startuml semana-05-flujo-issue-pr
title Flujo de integración: issue → rama → worktree → PR (por tarea T1..T5)
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor "Estudiante\n(@bquiroao)" as Est
participant "GitHub\nissue ASII-15" as Issue
participant "origin/develop" as Dev
participant "worktree\n../shi-asii-15-prescripciones-<tarea>" as WT
participant "PR → develop" as PR
actor "Revisor" as Rev

Est -> Issue : gh issue create (plan/issue-asii-15-prescripciones.md)
Est -> Dev : git fetch origin
Est -> WT : git worktree add … -b feature/asii-15-prescripciones-<tarea>-bquiroao origin/develop
loop por cada tarea (T1 esquema, T2 núcleo, T3 API, T4 integración, T5 seguridad)
  Est -> WT : commits pequeños (RED → GREEN → REFACTOR)
  Est -> WT : php tests/ejecutar.php · suite de contrato · validador
  Est -> PR : git push -u · gh pr create --body-file pr.md (Refs #ASII-15)
  Rev -> PR : revisión
  PR -> Dev : merge
  Est -> WT : git worktree remove · git branch -d
end
Est -> Issue : Closes #ASII-15 con el último PR
@enduml
